<title>JAPAN: NTT bid-only on addition to MSCI index.</title>
<headline>NTT bid-only on addition to MSCI index.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp (NTT) shares were bid-only in early Thursday morning trade after a foreign brokerage said it would include the issue in its Japan index, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0028 GMT, the shares were bid-only at 915,000 yen after closing at 895,000 yen on the previous day.  </p>
<p>Morgan Stanley Capital International (MSCI) said on Wednesday that it had added NTT to its Japan index, at a market capitalisation of 0.80 percent, effective after the market closing on May 30.</p>
</text>
